{"file": "1-Perustaso/Linnasmaki-Askelia-2/7_Puhelu_Kelaan.mp3", "duration": 86.39, "segments": [{"start": 12.78, "end": 15.76, "text": "Kela-asiakaspalvelu Merja Toivonen.", "words": [{"w": "Kela", "s": 12.78, "e": 13.76}, {"w": "-asiakaspalvelu", "s": 13.76, "e": 14.74}, {"w": "Merja", "s": 14.74, "e": 15.28}, {"w": "Toivonen.", "s": 15.28, "e": 15.76}]}, {"start": 16.34, "end": 21.5, "text": "Mikko Helminen tässä, hei. Soittelen noista asuntotukiasioista.", "words": [{"w": "Mikko", "s": 16.34, "e": 17.32}, {"w": "Helminen", "s": 17.32, "e": 17.72}, {"w": "tässä,", "s": 17.72, "e": 17.92}, {"w": "hei.", "s": 18.1, "e": 18.34}, {"w": "Soittelen", "s": 18.82, "e": 19.8}, {"w": "noista", "s": 19.8, "e": 20.18}, {"w": "asuntotukiasioista.", "s": 20.18, "e": 21.5}]}, {"start": 21.84, "end": 24.64, "text": "Jaahas, millainen tilanne teillä on?", "words": [{"w": "Jaahas,", "s": 21.84, "e": 22.48}, {"w": "millainen", "s": 23.08, "e": 23.58}, {"w": "tilanne", "s": 23.58, "e": 24.02}, {"w": "teillä", "s": 24.02, "e": 24.38}, {"w": "on?", "s": 24.38, "e": 24.64}]}, {"start": 24.64, "end": 33.82, "text": "No, olen just muuttanut uuteen asuntoon ja mulla nousi vuokra satasen. Olisin kysynyt, miten se vaikuttaa asumistukeen.", "words": [{"w": "No,", "s": 24.64, "e": 25.8}, {"w": "olen", "s": 26.16, "e": 26.34}, {"w": "just", "s": 26.34, "e": 26.58}, {"w": "muuttanut", "s": 26.58, "e": 27.08}, {"w": "uuteen", "s": 27.08, "e": 27.52}, {"w": "asuntoon", "s": 27.52, "e": 28.12}, {"w": "ja", "s": 28.12, "e": 28.72}, {"w": "mulla", "s": 28.72, "e": 28.98}, {"w": "nousi", "s": 28.98, "e": 29.36}, {"w": "vuokra", "s": 29.36, "e": 29.76}, {"w": "satasen.", "s": 29.76, "e": 30.42}, {"w": "Olisin", "s": 30.7, "e": 31.34}, {"w": "kysynyt,", "s": 31.34, "e": 31.9}, {"w": "miten", "s": 32.04, "e": 32.24}, {"w": "se", "s": 32.24, "e": 32.4}, {"w": "vaikuttaa", "s": 32.4, "e": 32.96}, {"w": "asumistukeen.", "s": 32.96, "e": 33.82}]}, {"start": 34.22, "end": 41.6, "text": "Joo, kyllä se todennäköisesti vaikuttaa. Oletko saanut ihan yleistä asumistukea?", "words": [{"w": "Joo,", "s": 34.22, "e": 35.04}, {"w": "kyllä", "s": 35.54, "e": 35.82}, {"w": "se", "s": 35.82, "e": 35.98}, {"w": "todennäköisesti", "s": 35.98, "e": 37.12}, {"w": "vaikuttaa.", "s": 37.12, "e": 38.26}, {"w": "Oletko", "s": 38.94, "e": 39.42}, {"w": "saanut", "s": 39.42, "e": 39.82}, {"w": "ihan", "s": 39.82, "e": 40.06}, {"w": "yleistä", "s": 40.06, "e": 40.58}, {"w": "asumistukea?", "s": 40.58, "e": 41.6}]}, {"start": 41.98, "end": 43.84, "text": "Kyllä, yleistä asumistukea.", "words": [{"w": "Kyllä,", "s": 41.98, "e": 42.52}, {"w": "yleistä", "s": 42.68, "e": 43.08}, {"w": "asumistukea.", "s": 43.08, "e": 43.84}]}, {"start": 43.84, "end": 59.82, "text": "Eli muuttotilanteessa teidän täytyy tehdä tarkistus. Sen voi tehdä verkossa, asiointipalvelussa tai paperisella lomakkeella AT1. Luuletteko, että tarvitsette apua tarkistuksen tekemisessä?", "words": [{"w": "Eli", "s": 43.84, "e": 45.16}, {"w": "muuttotilanteessa", "s": 45.16, "e": 46.62}, {"w": "teidän", "s": 46.62, "e": 47.0}, {"w": "täytyy", "s": 47.0, "e": 47.42}, {"w": "tehdä", "s": 47.42, "e": 47.8}, {"w": "tarkistus.", "s": 47.8, "e": 48.8}, {"w": "Sen", "s": 49.06, "e": 49.64}, {"w": "voi", "s": 49.64, "e": 50.02}, {"w": "tehdä", "s": 50.02, "e": 50.42}, {"w": "verkossa,", "s": 50.42, "e": 51.0}, {"w": "asiointipalvelussa", "s": 51.14, "e": 52.32}, {"w": "tai", "s": 52.32, "e": 52.56}, {"w": "paperisella", "s": 52.56, "e": 53.34}, {"w": "lomakkeella", "s": 53.34, "e": 54.12}, {"w": "AT1.", "s": 54.12, "e": 55.1}, {"w": "Luuletteko,", "s": 55.82, "e": 56.66}, {"w": "että", "s": 56.86, "e": 56.98}, {"w": "tarvitsette", "s": 56.98, "e": 57.64}, {"w": "apua", "s": 57.64, "e": 58.1}, {"w": "tarkistuksen", "s": 58.1, "e": 58.94}, {"w": "tekemisessä?", "s": 58.94, "e": 59.82}]}, {"start": 60.58, "end": 66.52, "text": "En tarvitse. Kyllä se varmaan onnistuu. Mä teen sen netissä, niin on helpointa.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 60.58, "e": 61.42}, {"w": "tarvitse.", "s": 61.42, "e": 61.9}, {"w": "Kyllä", "s": 62.3, "e": 62.68}, {"w": "se", "s": 62.68, "e": 62.8}, {"w": "varmaan", "s": 62.8, "e": 63.14}, {"w": "onnistuu.", "s": 63.14, "e": 63.76}, {"w": "Mä", "s": 64.04, "e": 64.2}, {"w": "teen", "s": 64.2, "e": 64.36}, {"w": "sen", "s": 64.36, "e": 64.52}, {"w": "netissä,", "s": 64.52, "e": 65.32}, {"w": "niin", "s": 65.5, "e": 65.76}, {"w": "on", "s": 65.76, "e": 65.94}, {"w": "helpointa.", "s": 65.94, "e": 66.52}]}, {"start": 66.52, "end": 74.0, "text": "Hyvä. Onko se meidän netin asiointipalvelu tuttu teille? Sinne kirjaudutaan nettipankkitunnuksilla.", "words": [{"w": "Hyvä.", "s": 66.52, "e": 67.26}, {"w": "Onko", "s": 67.72, "e": 68.3}, {"w": "se", "s": 68.3, "e": 68.44}, {"w": "meidän", "s": 68.44, "e": 68.7}, {"w": "netin", "s": 68.7, "e": 69.12}, {"w": "asiointipalvelu", "s": 69.12, "e": 70.14}, {"w": "tuttu", "s": 70.14, "e": 70.48}, {"w": "teille?", "s": 70.48, "e": 70.88}, {"w": "Sinne", "s": 71.2, "e": 71.56}, {"w": "kirjaudutaan", "s": 71.56, "e": 72.42}, {"w": "nettipankkitunnuksilla.", "s": 72.42, "e": 74.0}]}, {"start": 74.34, "end": 75.62, "text": "Joo, kyllä mä tiedän sen.", "words": [{"w": "Joo,", "s": 74.34, "e": 74.56}, {"w": "kyllä", "s": 74.78, "e": 74.94}, {"w": "mä", "s": 74.94, "e": 75.06}, {"w": "tiedän", "s": 75.06, "e": 75.44}, {"w": "sen.", "s": 75.44, "e": 75.62}]}, {"start": 75.94, "end": 82.66, "text": "Selvä. Ja soittakaa vain, jos tarvitsette apua. Tarvittaessa voidaan varata aika myös tänne toimistoon.", "words": [{"w": "Selvä.", "s": 75.94, "e": 76.34}, {"w": "Ja", "s": 76.64, "e": 77.1}, {"w": "soittakaa", "s": 77.1, "e": 77.62}, {"w": "vain,", "s": 77.62, "e": 77.82}, {"w": "jos", "s": 77.82, "e": 78.0}, {"w": "tarvitsette", "s": 78.0, "e": 78.64}, {"w": "apua.", "s": 78.64, "e": 79.12}, {"w": "Tarvittaessa", "s": 79.5, "e": 80.16}, {"w": "voidaan", "s": 80.16, "e": 80.6}, {"w": "varata", "s": 80.6, "e": 80.98}, {"w": "aika", "s": 80.98, "e": 81.32}, {"w": "myös", "s": 81.32, "e": 81.6}, {"w": "tänne", "s": 81.6, "e": 81.92}, {"w": "toimistoon.", "s": 81.92, "e": 82.66}]}, {"start": 83.1, "end": 84.52, "text": "Okei, kiitos teille.", "words": [{"w": "Okei,", "s": 83.1, "e": 83.7}, {"w": "kiitos", "s": 83.86, "e": 84.2}, {"w": "teille.", "s": 84.2, "e": 84.52}]}, {"start": 84.66, "end": 85.3, "text": "Kiitos, hei.", "words": [{"w": "Kiitos,", "s": 84.66, "e": 84.98}, {"w": "hei.", "s": 85.08, "e": 85.3}]}, {"start": 85.44, "end": 85.92, "text": "Hei hei.", "words": [{"w": "Hei", "s": 85.44, "e": 85.7}, {"w": "hei.", "s": 85.7, "e": 85.92}]}]}